      "text": "programa fatorial\n  inteiro x\n\n  func inteiro fat(inteiro n)\n  inicio\n     se n > 0\n        entao fat <- fat(n - 1) * n\n        senao fat <- 1\n     fimse\n  fimfunc\n\ninicio\n   leia x\n   escreva fat(x)\nfimprograma",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "programa fatorial\n  inteiro x\n\n  func inteiro fat(inteiro n)\n  inicio\n     se n > 0\n        entao fat <- fat(n - 1) * n\n        senao fat <- 1\n     fimse\n  fimfunc\n\ninicio\n   leia x\n   escreva fat(x)\nfimprograma",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
